## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database — New `threads` table

#### [MODIFY] [db_setup.py](file:///c:/Users/User-1/Music/informalServicesMPAgent/db_setup.py)

Add a `threads` table that links `thread_id → user_id + title + created_at`.

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS threads (
    thread_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
    user_id   TEXT NOT NULL,
    title     TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'New Conversation',
    created_at TEXT NOT NULL
)
```

The `setup_db()` function needs to be callable again without dropping existing data (the table uses `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS` so it is safe to re-run).

> [!NOTE]
> Since `db_setup.py` uses the synchronous `sqlite3` driver and is run once at startup, we add the new table there. All runtime reads/writes will use `aiosqlite` as already used elsewhere.

