### 4. SSE streaming for `POST /request`

#### [MODIFY] [main.py](file:///c:/Users/User-1/Music/informalServicesMPAgent/src/main.py)

- Add `from fastapi.responses import StreamingResponse`.
- Change the `request_endpoint` return type to a `StreamingResponse` with `media_type="text/event-stream"`.
- The inner async generator will:
  1. Determine new vs. existing thread.
  2. On **new** threads: call `generate_title()`, then `save_thread()` to `service_agent.db`.
  3. Use `graph.astream_events(state, config, version="v2")` to stream events.
  4. Yield `data: {"type": "agent_event", "agent": ..., "message": ...}\n\n` for each `on_chain_end` / `on_tool_end` event that carries a log update.
  5. After the stream ends, yield a final `data: {"type": "done", "task_id": ..., "status": ..., "assistant_message": ...}\n\n`.

> [!NOTE]
> `graph.astream_events` is available in LangGraph ≥ 0.2. The project already has `langgraph>=1.2.0` so this is safe.

