### 5. New endpoints in `main.py`

#### [MODIFY] [main.py](file:///c:/Users/User-1/Music/informalServicesMPAgent/src/main.py)

| Method | Path | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/threads/{user_id}` | Returns `[{thread_id, title, created_at}]` for the user |
| `GET` | `/threads/{thread_id}/messages` | Returns formatted `[{role, content}]` list for the thread |
| `GET` | `/bookings/{user_id}` | Returns `[{id, provider_name, service_type, booking_time, status}]` |

All three are simple async read endpoints — no graph invocation needed, just DB queries via `src/db.py`.

